# Daily AI Fact Refresh Worker v0.1 -- private, machine-local runtime
# state and per-run audit trail. See tools/daily_fact_worker/ for the
# worker's code (that IS meant to be committed) and
# docs/DAILY_AI_FACT_WORKER_V0_1.md for what lives here and why.
#
# Nothing under var/ is part of the public Fact record: run_state.json
# is this worker's private resume cursor, and runs/*.json is a private
# audit copy of each run's structured Worker Result (candidate Facts the
# External Fact Worker considered, including any that were rejected).
# The public system of record stays exactly daily/ and index/, both
# intentionally NOT listed here.
/var/

# Common local Python artifacts, in case a future contributor runs the
# worker's tests from a virtualenv inside this repository.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
